    <briefdescription>
<para>Strategy interface for a cluster-wide checkpoint store. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All worker nodes in a distributed ingestion run share a single <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_shared_checkpoint_store" kindref="compound">ISharedCheckpointStore</ref></computeroutput> so that incremental progress is visible across nodes and a failover worker can resume from the last committed offset.</para>
<para>In production this is backed by Redis or the ThemisDB checkpoint collection. For single-process deployments the default <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_in_memory_shared_checkpoint_store" kindref="compound">InMemorySharedCheckpointStore</ref></computeroutput> keeps state in a mutex-protected map so that multiple in-process workers see each other&apos;s checkpoints. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
